    "describe_ch": "本課程將帶領同學根據安全軟體開發生命週期應用軟體開發工具或平台，用以解決不同領域問題，包括需求定義、設計、開發、測試及部署等。",
    "describe_eh": "To solve various problems in different domains, students will learn how to use a software development kit or platform according to secure software development lifecycle, such as requirement definition, design, development, testing, and deployment, etc.",
